{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>股評人連敬涵於節目中推介美的集團(300)，指公司不再是單純的內需股，因為業務逐步邁向海外，而且企業客戶的增長亦強勁，兩者成為業績新的驅動，加上公司派息率不低，高回報提供估值支撐。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CYFcVSJscr1794474111.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>連敬涵原先建議100元買入，但早段股價回落較多，因此下調買入至99元，至於目標價上望110元，若失守94元(較原先下調1元)便止蝕。</p><p></p><p>美的集團(300)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$99</p><p>目標：$110</p><p>止蝕：$94</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BZFT5YWleT1794474258.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>股評人趙晞文推介兗礦能源(1171)，預期業績持續改善，而且煤炭價格短期可能造好，有利主要從事上游業務的兗礦，加上憧憬國策支持，對股價有提振作用。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268XHCqjumyg1794474299.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>趙晞文認為10.8元便可買入，目標價看12.1元，止蝕價在9.7元。</p><p></p><p>兗礦能源(1171)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$10.8</p><p>目標：$12.1</p><p>止蝕：$9.7</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.962281+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:37:35.189969+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:28.686887+00:00","content_hash":"b675f0fa88038a82df2bd2900ed4f363beb335ed28b1ca04703f9e7daac42456","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.962281+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}